<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Dec '96 unemployment 826,794 vs 835,564.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Dec '96 unemployment 826,794 vs 835,564.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV UNEMPLOYMENT   DEC 96	   NOV 96	  DEC 95</p>
<p> number seeking work    826,794	  835,564	 776,950</p>
<p> vacancies		   25,090	   29,131	  23,201</p>
<p> total employed	 2.053 million	 2.060 million     2.098 million</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data do not include private sector. Data cover the Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro. -- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
</text>
